 body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Girls,<\/p>\n<p>I just ordered these shoes yesterday. I didn't want heels but I wanted something to give me a bit of height. I figured wedge shoes were the way to go. So here they are. Post pictures of what shoes you will be wearing?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c16c44343f60c35d350778a8562ffc97","RawContent":"Love the lace look! I&#039;d totally do that if I wasn&#039;t wearing sandals!  \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879446,"PostDate":1417531357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love the lace look! I'd totally do that if I wasn't wearing sandals!  <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1879446]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277873-141753135356.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1417531349.754834.jpg - Size: 342.32KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-277873-141753135356.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1417531349.754834.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.95.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e531031d8ba7a45b9ae5807d528503d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Nice Sandels and I wish I was tall enough to just wear flats. lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879473,"PostDate":1417546328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Nice Sandels and I wish I was tall enough to just wear flats. lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395346614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"h