{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1201,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":5,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":79333,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1549528,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":242762,"Name":"SunsetLove","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242762.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1321970902,"LastPoster":{"Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1896609,"PostDate":1432048540,"PostContent":"@Sabes44 So close!! So excited for you!","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60547ff9bce62c0f11e96ea29b1911da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] Have the BEST time!! You will make the most beautiful bride. can&#039;t wait to hear all about it. Enjoy everything. Don&#039;t stress! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895915,"PostDate":1431345649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> Have the BEST time!! You will make the most beautiful bride. can't wait to hear all about it. Enjoy everything. Don't stress! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.161.160.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dba28e83b13e4f4474386a8e05f5c0b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies,&amp;nbsp; just wanted to write a quick note.&amp;nbsp; We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!&amp;nbsp; We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.&amp;nbsp; Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!&amp;nbsp; No complaints about anything.&amp;nbsp; Jessica was on top of everything.&amp;nbsp; I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.&amp;nbsp; This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.&amp;nbsp; If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.&amp;nbsp; All I can say is don&#039;t stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895930,"PostDate":1431356033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,\u00a0 just wanted to write a quick note.\u00a0 We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!\u00a0 We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.\u00a0 Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!\u00a0 No complaints about anything.\u00a0 Jessica was on top of everything.\u00a0 I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.\u00a0 This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.\u00a0 If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.\u00a0 All I can say is don't stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crystalz1717@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.125.56.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399744378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Crystal17","Id":277916,"Name":"Crystal17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2424b45b52efe805bbc96aa4af888ae","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JenniferH114\" post=\"1895912\" timestamp=\"1431357080\"]\nIn just under 48 hours we&#039;ll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can&#039;t believe a year has gone by so quickly. :)[\/quote]@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] congrats!!!! Good luck with everything!! Can&#039;t wait to hear about it!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895984,"PostDate":1431418132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JenniferH114, on 11 May 2015 - 11:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>In just under 48 hours we'll be on the plane to the ERC!!! I can't believe a year has gone by so quickly. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> congrats!!!! Good luck with everything!! Can't wait to hear about it!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinjohnson3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399990051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1431696721","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"upstatekj","Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.217.128.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2f39cffe1a2dae6ed7b595619640a4b","RawContent":"Hi everyone! I&#039;m in the very early phase of planning a destination wedding here for next May 2016. Do you girls have any feedback about doing a group contract with a travel agent? I was thinking that would be the best way to go, but the prices per person for the room rate I got is higher than I expected. Seems like you can find a much better rate on websites such as Expedia,Travelocity (that&#039;s what I did when I went last year). I know without the group contract I wouldn&#039;t get the group amenities this way, but I just feel nervous giving guests the room rate when I&#039;m sure they could get much cheaper with a flight\/hotel package deal through one of the travel websites. Let me know your thoughts on this!  thanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1896089,"PostDate":1431472272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! I'm in the very early phase of planning a destination wedding here for next May 2016. Do you girls have any feedback about doing a group contract with a travel agent? I was thinking that would be the best way to go, but the prices per person for the room rate I got is higher than I expected. Seems like you can find a much better rate on websites such as Expedia,Travelocity (that's what I did when I went last year). I know without the group contract I wouldn't get the group amenities this way, but I just feel nervous giving guests the room rate when I'm sure they could get much cheaper with a flight\/hotel package deal through one of the travel websites. Let me know your thoughts on this!  thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kathryn.fraser@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.215.8.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376674778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272662.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kathryn78","Id":272662,"Name":"kathryn78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83739b940a0dbfa62dfc82c2a7438abd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kathryn78\" post=\"1896089\" timestamp=\"1431486672\"]\nHi everyone! I&#039;m in the very early phase of planning a destination wedding here for next May 2016. Do you girls have any feedback about doing a group contract with a travel agent? I was thinking that would be the best way to go, but the prices per person for the room rate I got is higher than I expected. Seems like you can find a much better rate on websites such as Expedia,Travelocity (that&#039;s what I did when I went last year). I know without the group contract I wouldn&#039;t get the group amenities this way, but I just feel nervous giving guests the room rate when I&#039;m sure they could get much cheaper with a flight\/hotel package deal through one of the travel websites. Let me know your thoughts on this! thanks :)[\/quote]Hi Katheryn78! and congrats on your wedding! A family friend of mine is a travel agent so we used her to coordinate our group. Because of the quantity of groups she has coming to Excellence Riviera, we got a pretty good deal, I think. Room rates are tricky - if you are constantly looking and staying on top of rates, you can def find better rates than what they provide. And also the timing of your wedding will effect the rates. We ended up with a rate of $210 per person per night for the standard room (I&#039;m getting married July 4th weekend). And included in our group package are amenities like free welcome party, 10% off spa services, early check-in, etc. I had some guests question the rates but it was only a matter of a few dollars and our travel agent kindly explained that there are additional items included in ours. Our travel agent also coordinates transportation to the resort which is a huge help for me. She&#039;s also been to the resort so I bounce ideas off of her to help with my planning. Maybe go back to yours and ask if they can try to meet the current rate? They are flexible sometimes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896114,"PostDate":1431507030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kathryn78, on 12 May 2015 - 11:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone! I'm in the very early phase of planning a destination wedding here for next May 2016. Do you girls have any feedback about doing a group contract with a travel agent? I was thinking that would be the best way to go, but the prices per person for the room rate I got is higher than I expected. Seems like you can find a much better rate on websites such as Expedia,Travelocity (that's what I did when I went last year). I know without the group contract I wouldn't get the group amenities this way, but I just feel nervous giving guests the room rate when I'm sure they could get much cheaper with a flight\/hotel package deal through one of the travel websites. Let me know your thoughts on this! thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Katheryn78! and congrats on your wedding! A family friend of mine is a travel agent so we used her to coordinate our group. Because of the quantity of groups she has coming to Excellence Riviera, we got a pretty good deal, I think. Room rates are tricky - if you are constantly looking and staying on top of rates, you can def find better rates than what they provide. And also the timing of your wedding will effect the rates. We ended up with a rate of $210 per person per night for the standard room (I'm getting married July 4th weekend). And included in our group package are amenities like free welcome party, 10% off spa services, early check-in, etc. I had some guests question the rates but it was only a matter of a few dollars and our travel agent kindly explained that there are additional items included in ours. Our travel agent also coordinates transportation to the resort which is a huge help for me. She's also been to the resort so I bounce ideas off of her to help with my planning. Maybe go back to yours and ask if they can try to meet the current rate? They are flexible sometimes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinjohnson3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399990051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1431696721","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"upstatekj","Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05fa3ee4e044abdaf0060dd816406691","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Crystal17\"] Yay! Congratulations. We are so happy for you. I&#039;m so glad it was an easy breezy process and so glad Jessica was so great. I keep hearing such wonderful things about her. I can&#039;t wait to see pictures of your big day! Did you have your wedding at 5pm?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kathryn78\"] Welcome! And Congratulations! Our weddings are so close. Mine is April 29 2016. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;An old coworker of mine is a travel agent so we decided to go that route. I&#039;ve been to ERC and booked through her the last time but have done many trips alone on expedia\/cheapcaribbean. The good thing about a travel agent is it takes a lot of the pressure off YOU. I found that I could, in fact find cheaper rates but I found it more convenient to book airport transfers, flights, rooms etc all in one transaction. It is also helping my guests that aren&#039;t big travelers not have to feel the pressure of looking for everything on their own. No one HAS to use the travel agent that you provide. You may just want to encourage them to if you can get some extra perks. For example we get money back, based on how many people book. Every little bit helps! But if it&#039;s easier on you, you could give them that option and leave the choice up to your guests how they want to book.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896115,"PostDate":1431507374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277916\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277916-crystal17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Crystal17<\/span><\/a> Yay! Congratulations. We are so happy for you. I'm so glad it was an easy breezy process and so glad Jessica was so great. I keep hearing such wonderful things about her. I can't wait to see pictures of your big day! Did you have your wedding at 5pm?<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272662\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272662-kathryn78\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kathryn78<\/span><\/a> Welcome! And Congratulations! Our weddings are so close. Mine is April 29 2016. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>An old coworker of mine is a travel agent so we decided to go that route. I've been to ERC and booked through her the last time but have done many trips alone on expedia\/cheapcaribbean. The good thing about a travel agent is it takes a lot of the pressure off YOU. I found that I could, in fact find cheaper rates but I found it more convenient to book airport transfers, flights, rooms etc all in one transaction. It is also helping my guests that aren't big travelers not have to feel the pressure of looking for everything on their own. No one HAS to use the travel agent that you provide. You may just want to encourage them to if you can get some extra perks. For example we get money back, based on how many people book. Every little bit helps! But if it's easier on you, you could give them that option and leave the choice up to your guests how they want to book.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"victoria_salv@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.244.233.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423160562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282014.jpg?_r=1428610987","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"victoriasalv","Id":282014,"Name":"victoriasalv","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.13.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b090c6aea3e13c76bd4a6352f905504d","RawContent":"Thanks for the input!! I&#039;m going to use the travel agent and offer that to people, but people can also book on their own too if they&#039;d like. :).","Attachments":[],"Id":1896292,"PostDate":1431601732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the input!! I'm going to use the travel agent and offer that to people, but people can also book on their own too if they'd like. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kathryn.fraser@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.215.8.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376674778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272662.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kathryn78","Id":272662,"Name":"kathryn78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"095cff00cdcb3be59f1cfd0518ef8516","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Crystal17\" post=\"1895930\" timestamp=\"1431370433\"]\nHi ladies,  just wanted to write a quick note.  We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!  We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.  Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!  No complaints about anything.  Jessica was on top of everything.  I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.  This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.  If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.  All I can say is don&#039;t stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect![\/quote]@[member=\"Crystal17\"], how was your hair and makeup? Was Elias still there?? Do you have any pics we can see yet? :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1896369,"PostDate":1431679054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Crystal17, on 11 May 2015 - 02:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi ladies,\u00a0 just wanted to write a quick note.\u00a0 We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!\u00a0 We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.\u00a0 Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!\u00a0 No complaints about anything.\u00a0 Jessica was on top of everything.\u00a0 I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.\u00a0 This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.\u00a0 If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.\u00a0 All I can say is don't stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277916\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277916-crystal17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Crystal17<\/span><\/a>, how was your hair and makeup? Was Elias still there?? Do you have any pics we can see yet? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinjohnson3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.75.123.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399990051,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277949.jpg?_r=1431696721","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"upstatekj","Id":277949,"Name":"upstatekj","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.77.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbd9a8e2cf557a9a024b7354b36acafb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"upstatekj\" post=\"1896369\" timestamp=\"1431679054\"]\n[quote name=\"Crystal17\" post=\"1895930\" timestamp=\"1431370433\"]\nHi ladies,  just wanted to write a quick note.  We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!  We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.  Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!  No complaints about anything.  Jessica was on top of everything.  I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.  This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.  If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.  All I can say is don&#039;t stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect![\/quote]@[member=\"Crystal17\"], how was your hair and makeup? Was Elias still there?? Do you have any pics we can see yet? :)[\/quote]Yayyy congratulations, show us some pics :) also how did hair and makeup come out ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1896374,"PostDate":1431680957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>upstatekj, on 15 May 2015 - 04:37 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><\/p><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"Crystal17\" data-cid=\"1895930\" data-time=\"1431370433\"><p>\nHi ladies,  just wanted to write a quick note.  We are back from our wedding and everything went perfect!  We had cermony on beach, cocktail hour on beach by Oregano and then reception at lobster house.  Our photog was Sasha Gluck and our DJ was Julian Molina from JWD Events. Both were great!  No complaints about anything.  Jessica was on top of everything.  I had a welcome dinner at Oregano and that went great as well.  This was our 4th time at Excellence and we will definitely go there for our 1yr anniversary.  If you have any questions let me know, we know this resort pretty well.  All I can say is don't stress, Jessica really had everything in order and perfect!<\/p><\/div><\/div>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277916\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277916-crystal17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Crystal17<\/span><\/a>, how was your hair and makeup? Was Elias still there?? Do you have any pics we can see yet? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote>\nYayyy congratulations, show us some pics <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> also how did hair and makeup come out ?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"giociviletti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.229.218.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420827388,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281659.jpg?_r=1432056569","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Giocivs88","Id":281659,"Name":"Giocivs88","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64583,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e91018ad72a9c0bc167098b7e5955792","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;victoriasalv&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;our ceremony was 5:30, cocktail hour 6:00 then reception 7:00-11:00&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kathryn78\"] we used destinationweddings.com as our travel agent and they were great.&amp;nbsp; We had Pam Gramling and she helped with all the booking.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"upstatekj\"] Elias is not there anymore.&amp;nbsp; I had a women do my hair and makeup.  I loved both but it was windy on beach so my veil\/hair&amp;nbsp;kept flying around.&amp;nbsp; I had loose&amp;nbsp;waves.&amp;nbsp; My MOH&amp;nbsp;had her hair up&amp;nbsp;and it was much better with the wind!&amp;nbsp; She has a book with pics of hair you can look through but I would bring a pic&amp;nbsp;of hair and makeup you want. I&#039;ll try to upload pics now!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896607,"PostDate":1432047085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282014-victoriasalv\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>victoriasalv<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0our ceremony was 5:30, cocktail hour 6:00 then reception 7:00-11:00<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272662\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/272662-kathryn78\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kathryn78<\/span><\/a> we used destinationweddings.com as our travel agent and they were great.\u00a0 We had Pam Gramling and she helped with all the booking.<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277949\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277949-upstatekj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">upstatekj<\/span><\/a> Elias is not there anymore.\u00a0 I had a women do my hair and makeup.\u00a0\u00a0I loved both but it was windy on beach so my veil\/hair\u00a0kept flying around.\u00a0 I had loose\u00a0waves.\u00a0 My MOH\u00a0had her hair up\u00a0and it was much better with the wind!\u00a0 She has a book with pics of hair you can look through but I would bring a pic\u00a0of hair and makeup you want. I'll try to upload pics now!\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crystalz1717@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.125.56.133","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399744378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Crystal17","Id":277916,"Name":"Crystal17","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"64583","Title":"Excellence Riviera Cancun Brides?","LastPostDate":1432048540},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1201,"TotalPages":121,"CurrentPage":1190,"NextPage":1200,"PreviousPage":1180,"LastPage":1200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
